  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　りょうりに　つかう\nしょくざいの　いっしゅ。あげてから\nじかんがたつので　すこし　あぶらっこい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "캠프 요리에 사용되는\n식재료 중 하나. 튀기고\n시간이 좀 지나서 살짝 느끼하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "製作露營料理時使用的食材之一。\n已經炸好一段時間，\n所以有點油膩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient de cuisine pour le camping.\nCes fritures sont sorties de la friteuse depuis\nun moment déjà, et l’huile a commencé à couler.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Zutat für PokéCamping-Mahlzeiten. Diese Beilagen\nsind recht fettig, da sie schon vor einer Weile aus der\nFritteuse geholt wurden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente para cocinar en el campamento. A\nmedida que pasa el tiempo se van volviendo más\naceitosas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Uno degli ingredienti che puoi usare per cucinare\nin campeggio. È passato del tempo dal momento\ndella frittura, per cui è un po’ untuoso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the many ingredients that can be used for\ncooking at your camp. It’s been a while since it was\nfried, so it’s gotten greasy.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャンプの　料理に　使う\n食材の　一種。揚げてから\n時間がたつので　少し　油っこい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在露营营地制作料理时会使用的\n一种食材。炸完出锅后\n放置了一段时间，所以稍稍有些油腻。",
